  <Thumbnail>bd178c42-a911-4b46-b662-45cba6573539</Thumbnail>
  <History Date="08-03-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created (no pixel layout - guessed where possible.  DMX+NET Net part charts are not defined properly and don't make sense.  made best guess)" Version="0" />
  <History Date="08-03-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from BeamZ Nuke1 (no pixel layout - cannot be guessed.  pixels in 84, 310 and 324 channel modes are not defined properly in the charts and don't make sense.  made best guess)" Version="9" />
  <History Date="14-03-24" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's.  DMX+NET NET part channel count doesn't agree.  Charts are nonsense so omitted the DMX+NET parts for now (at the time of writing these are not currently simulated properly in Titan anyway)" Version="12" />
